# NestJS monorepo

- Thin controllers, logic in services; feature modules.
- Config via `ConfigModule` / env — no hardcoded hosts in code defaults beyond localhost fallbacks.
- TypeORM: `synchronize: false` always; schema only via Liquibase.
- New service must mirror siblings: `apm.ts`, `trace-logging.interceptor.ts`, `/health`, Dockerfile, `tsconfig.app.json`, nest-cli project + package scripts.
- Server-to-server HTTP = `HttpService` (@nestjs/axios), not raw ad-hoc clients unless already used (gateway proxy).
- No AI-slop comments; no drive-by refactors outside the task.
